===About===
The European Quake League, most commonly referred to as EQL, was the most active 4on4 QuakeWorld league in European for over a decade. It was founded in the autumn of 2005 to fill the void left by NQR following the crash of the [http://www.quakeworld.nu quakeworld.nu] server, and thus [http://nqr.quakeworld.nu NQR's] web hosting.
